_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"2處獨立位置，2個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu-040-ws2606035-jiachong-family"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"id":"nc-jin040-jiachong-086","person_id":"ax9_dt0_616","surname":"周","ming":"勤","additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-040-jiachong-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-040-jiachong-family:p024","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-040-jiachong-family:p024:m0025","quote":"初，充伐呉時，嘗屯項城，軍中忽失充所在。充帳下都督周勤時晝寢，夢見百餘人錄充，引入一逕。勤驚覺，聞失充，乃出尋索，忽睹所夢之道。遂往求之。果見充行至一府舍，侍衞甚盛。府公南南坐，聲色甚厲，謂充曰：「將亂吾家事，必爾與荀勖，既惑吾子，又亂吾孫。間使任愷黜汝而不去，又使庾純詈汝而不改。今呉寇當平，汝方表斬張華。汝之暗戇，皆此類也。若不悛慎，當旦夕加罪。」充因叩頭流血，公曰：「汝所以延日月而名器如此者，是衞府之勳耳。終當使繫嗣死於鐘虡之間，大子斃於金酒之中，小子困於枯木之下。荀勖亦宜同，然其先德小濃。故在汝後，數世之外，國嗣亦替。」言畢，命去。充忽然得還營，顏色憔悴，性理昏喪，經日乃復。及是，謐死於鐘下，賈后服金酒而死，賈午考竟用大杖。終皆如所言。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"note":"本源所見稱名；按中古姓氏用法分讀，保原字及逐名錨，不作全庫權威選字。","fixed_biography_name_binding":{"kind":"fixed_punctuated_biography_name","source_revision":2606035,"paragraph_sha256":"78e780bbdff3d5db8ffc7ccebc363d2d6c907646ba38bd486f64b7c1e5bcca67","mode":"full_name","name_mention_id":"c-jinshu-040-jiachong-family:p024:m0025","zi_mention_id":null,"alias_bindings":[],"title_prefix":null,"title_suffix":null},"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-040","source_id":"s-jinshu-040-ws2606035-jiachong-family"}],"mentions":[{"id":"